# MarketingOS 2.0 (SwarmOps) — Complete Project Summary

## What It Is

**MarketingOS 2.0** (internally called **SwarmOps**) is a **multi-agent AI marketing platform** — a full-stack application where **10+ specialized AI agents** collaborate to handle every aspect of digital marketing: SEO, content creation, PPC advertising, analytics, social media, CRM, conversion optimization, brand strategy, UX design, and deep research.

The system uses a central **orchestrator (The Nexus)** that intelligently routes user requests to the right agent(s), supports multi-agent pipelines, manages budgets, and even facilitates **agent debates** when agents disagree on strategy.

