|-------|-----------|
| **Frontend** | React 19, Recharts (charts), Zustand (state), Lucide icons, react-markdown |
| **Backend** | FastAPI (Python), Pydantic models, CORS middleware |
| **AI Providers** | Groq (Llama 3.3 70B), Google Gemini 2.0 Flash, OpenRouter, NVIDIA (Kimi K2.5), DeepSeek |
| **Database** | SQLite ([marketingos.db](file:///c:/Users/shrav/OneDrive/Desktop/MarketingOS2.0/marketingos.db)) + JSON files for memory |
| **Integrations** | Google Analytics 4, Google Search Console, Google Ads, HubSpot, WordPress, DataForSEO |
| **Search** | Brave Search API, Serper.dev (Google results) |
| **Deployment** | Docker, Railway (backend), Vercel (frontend) |

